     A* ======================================================================
     A* CUSTDSPF - Customer maintenance screens
     A* Author: Arnav    Created: 2026-10-06
     A*
     A* Formats: CUSTSFL/CUSTCTL = customer list (load-all subfile)
     A*          CUSTKEY         = key legend under the list (line 23)
     A*          CUSTDTL         = one customer, mode ADD/EDIT/DISPLAY/DELETE
     A*          MSGSFL/MSGCTL   = message subfile on line 24 (as MENUDSPF)
     A*
     A* Indicator map:
     A*   03 F3=Exit app      05 F5=Add     06 F6=Edit    07 F7=Delete
     A*   10 F10=Save/Confirm 12 F12=Back
     A*   31 SFLDSP (list has rows)        32 SFLDSPCTL   33 SFLCLR
     A*   34 SFLEND (show More.../Bottom)
     A*   41 protect Cust No (all modes except ADD)
     A*   42 protect the other fields (DISPLAY, DELETE)
     A*   51 Cust No in error   52 Name in error   53 Status in error
     A*   98 message subfile end marker
     A*
     A* Field names CUSTNO, CUSTNAME... look like CSTMST's, but CUSTPGM
     A* opens CSTMST with PREFIX(F_), so they are NOT shared: data moves
     A* only in CUSTPGM's ToScreen/ToFile. City is 30 long in the file -
     A* too wide for the list - so the list shows LCITY (first 20 chars).
     A* F6/F7/F10 are CF keys (screen data comes back with them); F3/F5/F12
     A* are CA keys (no data needed).
     A*
     A* Change log:
     A*   2026-10-06  Arnav  Created (Sprint 2, checkpoint 2C)
     A*   2026-10-07  Arnav  Comment: fields not shared (PREFIX in CUSTPGM)
     A* ======================================================================
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A                                      CA03(03 'F3=Exit')
     A                                      CA12(12 'F12=Back')
     A*
     A* List row (one per customer)
     A          R CUSTSFL                   SFL
     A            SEL            1A  B  6  3
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A            CUSTNO         7Y 0O  6  6EDTCDE(Z)
     A            CUSTNAME      40A  O  6 15
     A            LCITY         20A  O  6 57
     A            STATUS         1A  O  6 79
     A*
     A* List control: heading, the subfile, the key legend
     A          R CUSTCTL                   SFLCTL(CUSTSFL)
     A                                      SFLSIZ(9999)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0010)
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      CF05(05 'F5=Add')
     A                                      CF06(06 'F6=Edit')
     A                                      CF07(07 'F7=Delete')
     A  31                                  SFLDSP
     A  32                                  SFLDSPCTL
     A  33                                  SFLCLR
     A  34                                  SFLEND(*MORE)
     A                                  1  2'CUSTLIST'
     A                                  1 30'CUSTOMER MAINTENANCE'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 72DATE EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                  2 71USER
     A                                  4  2'Type X, then Enter=Display  -
     A                                      F6=Edit  F7=Delete'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A                                  5  2'Sel'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5  6'Cust No'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5 15'Customer Name'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5 57'City'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5 77'Sts'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A*
     A* Key legend for the list. A separate record: the control record
     A* may not have fields below the subfile (CPD7812).
     A          R CUSTKEY                   OVERLAY
     A                                 23  2'F3=Exit  F5=Add  F6=Edit  -
     A                                      F7=Delete  F12=Back'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A* Detail: one customer. MODE and LEGEND are set by CUSTPGM.
     A          R CUSTDTL                   OVERLAY
     A                                      CF10(10 'F10=Save')
     A                                  1  2'CUSTDTL'
     A                                  1 30'CUSTOMER MAINTENANCE'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 64'Mode:'
     A            MODE           8A  O  1 70DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  2 71USER
     A                                  4  3'Customer No . :'
     A            CUSTNO         7Y 0B  4 20EDTCDE(Z)
     A  41                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  51                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N41                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5  3'Name  . . . . :'
     A            CUSTNAME      40A  B  5 20
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  52                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  6  3'Address . . . :'
     A            ADDRESS       50A  B  6 20
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  7  3'City  . . . . :'
     A            CITY          30A  B  7 20
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  8  3'State . . . . :'
     A            STATE         20A  B  8 20
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  9  3'Status  . . . :'
     A            STATUS         1A  B  9 20
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  53                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  9 24'(A=Active, I=Inactive)'
     A            LEGEND        78A  O 23  2COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A* Message subfile - same as MENUDSPF
     A          R MSGSFL                    SFL
     A                                      SFLMSGRCD(24)
     A            MSGKEY                    SFLMSGKEY
     A            PGMQ                      SFLPGMQ(10)
     A          R MSGCTL                    SFLCTL(MSGSFL)
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      SFLDSP
     A                                      SFLDSPCTL
     A                                      SFLINZ
     A  98                                  SFLEND
     A                                      SFLSIZ(0002)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0001)
     A            PGMQ                      SFLPGMQ(10)
